This product includes rule text and tariff data extracted from documents
published by others:

  KORUS Free Trade Agreement, Annex 6-A (Specific Rules of Origin) and
  Annex 2-B (Tariff Schedule of the United States), Office of the United
  States Trade Representative.

  Korea-European Union Free Trade Agreement, Annex 2-A (tariff schedule of the
  EU Party), published in the Official Journal of the European Union, L 127,
  and the Korean language copy of the same table issued by the Ministry of
  Trade, Industry and Energy.

  Korea-European Union Free Trade Agreement, Protocol on rules of origin,
  Annex II (product specific rules), published in the Official Journal of the
  European Union, L 127.

  Regional Comprehensive Economic Partnership, Annex 3A (Product-Specific
  Rules), HS 2022 transposition adopted by the RCEP Joint Committee.

  Regional Comprehensive Economic Partnership, Annex I, Schedule of Tariff
  Commitments of Japan.

  FTA 활용지원을 위한 관세행정 추진전략, 기획재정부, 2025-02-12.

  World Integrated Trade Solution / TRAINS applied tariff data, World Bank.

The schedule and rule rows carry the id of the document they came from, and
docs/SOURCES.md lists each document with its URL, its download date and its
sha256. Those extracts are reproduced as cited quotations for a compliance
check; the documents remain the property of their publishers and are not
relicensed here. The code in this repository is licensed under the Apache
